---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🧑‍🚀 Greetings to all tech lovers!</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to Techtips.fun! Here, we share real tech experiences, tips, and insights to help you navigate the everyday tech world. From troubleshooting guides to product reviews, we provide practical advices and solution for tech lovers and enthutiastics. Join our community and stay updated with the latest tech trends and tips!
			</p>
			<p>
				
			</p>
			<p>Here are a few tips on how to get started with our blogposts:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Edit Visit our blog page in <code>src/pages/blog.astro to read our latest posts. </code></li>
				<li>Edit See top and popular post by going here <code>src/components/Header.astro</code></li>
				<li>Send your suggestion or your query by visiting  <code>src/page/contact,astro</code></li>
				<li>If you wanna know who we are, simply check out the About Us <code>src/content/blog/</code></li>
				
			</ul>
			<p>
				Have fun! If you get stuck anywhere, remember to <a href="https://docs.astro.build/"
					>read the docs
				</a> or <a href="https://astro.build/chat">join us on Discord</a> to ask questions.
			</p>
		
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
